# Planning, research and working notes. Never published.
#
# The repository is a public artefact: everything tracked here is written for someone who has
# just arrived and wants to use or contribute to the app. Roadmaps, competitive research, session
# plans and half-formed decisions are working material - they read as commitments once they are
# public, and a plan that changes weekly is worse than no plan at all. Keep them here; when
# something is settled, it graduates into CHANGELOG.md, CLAUDE.md or the READMEs in finished form.
.internal/
NOTES.md
